            <title>[IGNITE-4935] .NET: IgniteConfiguration.EventStorageSpi</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4935</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4812&quot; title=&quot;Disable EventStorageSpi by default&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-4812&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-4812&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; introduced &lt;tt&gt;NoOpEventStorageSpi&lt;/tt&gt; which is now the default. This breaks event queries in .NET, and the only workaround is Spring XML.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Let&apos;s add this to C# configuration and fix tests.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
